<title>JAPAN: Musashino Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Musashino Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    36.75		vs	   43.64</p>
<p> Operating	    6.51		vs	    6.38</p>
<p> Current		 3.7		vs	    3.01</p>
<p> Net		    1.55		vs	    1.30</p>
<p> EPS		   57.27 yen	  vs	   56.81 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     27 million	  vs	  23 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 25.00 yen	  vs	   25.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Musashino Bank Ltd is a regional bank based in Saitama prefecture.</p>
</text>
